Bootstrap: docker
From: nvidia/cuda:13.0.3-runtime-ubuntu24.04

%files
    install.sh /opt/ef2-install.sh

%post
    sh /opt/ef2-install.sh
    rm /opt/ef2-install.sh

%environment
    export HF_HOME=${HF_HOME:-/hf}

%runscript
    exec /opt/venv/bin/python "$@"

%labels
    org.opencontainers.image.title RESIDUDES ESMFold2
    org.opencontainers.image.description ESMFold2: python 3.12, torch 2.12 and the Biohub transformers fork. The runner scripts and the HuggingFace weight cache are bind-mounted.
    org.opencontainers.image.source https://github.com/DeepFoldProtein/RESIDUDES
    org.opencontainers.image.licenses MIT

%help
    ESMFold2. The runner scripts and the weights are bind-mounted:

        apptainer run --nv -B /path/to/esm:/opt/esm -B /data/esmfold2_hf:/hf \
            residudes-ef2.sif /opt/esm/inferences/esmfold2/run_inference.py input.json out/ \
            --seeds 1 --layout flat

    residudes-engine calls this through [site] esm / esm_python; see docs/esmfold2.md.
